<title>USA: Oriental Fin'l sets stock div, higher pay.</title>
<headline>Oriental Fin'l sets stock div, higher pay.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oriental Financial Group said directors declared a 25 percent stock dividend and an increased cash dividend of $0.125 on the shares outstanding after the stock dividend.</p>
<p>It said both the stock and cash dividend are payable October 15 to holders of record September 30.</p>
<p>Oriental's prior payment, on a pre-split basis, was $0.15, equal to $0.1125 on a post-split basis.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
